# Testing and Paper Trading

## MVP must default to paper-only

Do not make live order submission reachable by default. If broker clients exist, wrap them behind interfaces and default to paper mode. Live mode must require the `config.toml` gates described in `11-runtime-config-and-mode.mdc`.

## Test priorities

1. Pydantic schema validation
2. Date-ID existence validation
3. Allocator rejection/fallback
4. PaperBroker internal ledger invariants
5. cash/target percentage basis
6. single-stock 5% cumulative buy-cost cap
7. gold 15~25 validation
8. directional slippage
9. scheduler DST handling
10. Postmortem tag extraction
11. Debug.md exclusion from Top 3 tags
12. config loader fails closed for missing/invalid config
13. live mode requires mode + allow flag + environment confirmation
14. MDD staged liquidation thresholds and cooldowns
15. emergency trigger threshold detection
16. gold trade frequency and micro-adjust handling
17. KIS live read-only/tiny-live smoke tests isolated from PaperBroker performance ledger

